### ============================================================================
### Player Scout API — 00. Health Check
### Compatível com a extensão REST Client (VS Code / Antigravity)
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health Check Raiz (/health)
# @name healthRoot
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Health Check API v1 (/api/v1/health)
# @name healthApiV1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json
